:: Bog Cult Salem Plant
The plants seem to be of all types. You can spot Asters and Vervain among other more dangerous species like Nightshade. You probably shouldn't touch them.
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Read
You take a book off the shelf and read the title. "Magnus Liber Ultra" its pages are clean and new but it looks to have been copied from an older text. It seems to be something of an old journal or Bible. It documents the life of an unnamed author and their pursuit of the truth of the universe. In the end the author writes of their approaching demise and desire to preserve their knowledge. You assume something bad must have happened to the original members of the fellowship. 
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Initiation
<<npc Salem>><<person1>>
"You ready?" <<He>> asks calmly. It appears that <<he>> has steeled <<himself>> in anticipation. "Please follow me one more time."
<br><br>
Salem leads you back to the main hall of the temple where a large group has begun to gather. "Honorable elders." Salem speaks up and bows, prostrating <<himself>> before the elders. "I have taken it upon myself to speak to the interloper and have reached a conclusion. I humbly request that we innitate <<pher>> as a member of the fellowship." <<He>> continues to hold his head to the floor in reverence as the group stands in a moment of silence.
<br><br>
"Salem." A raspy voice rises from the body of one of the elders. "We have... much to discuss." They look down upon <<him>> for several minutes before speaking once more. "We... Shall carry out this initiation... However... We wish to speak with you alone afterward... Salem..." The room is hushed once again, the only noise breaking the silence is the flickering of candles.
<br><br>
"You... Child..." The elder points their long bony finger in your direction. "Lie upon the altar..." Everyone's eyes are on you and you feel compelled to listen. You lie upon the alter as the elders surround you. You feel cloth cover your eyes as the surroundings fade to black. You feel a tingle before a searing pain on your stomach. The pain spreads to your sides and chest as you breath more heavily. The elders begin to chant in a language you're unfamiliar with before you feel a strong ripping sensation, leaving your torso feeling raw. Finally after a moment, the blindfold is removed. Your skin is red raw and strips of wax line the altar. "You child... You will share a room with Salem..." Deeming their job done, the elders hobble away slowly. 
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Bog Cult]]>><<set $cultjoined to 1>><<set $salempunishment to 1>><<set $salemgone to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

