<br><br>
"O-okay, so... You have to be extra careful because this here is Nightshade, and it can be very dangerous if handled incorrectly." <<He>> hands you some simple gardening supplies and watches as you prune the plants.
<br><br>
<<if $tending gte 600>>
    "Whoa, you're so talented." Salem peers over your shoulder in awe. "I didn't realize you were such a talented gardener." Salem catches <<himself>> talking and covers <<his>> mouth, blushing. "I-I mean, uh... sorry." <<He>> looks away awkwardly.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><<npcincr Salem love 3>><<endevent>><</link>><<gglove>>
<<else>>
    "Careful, careful." Salem nervously glances over your shoulder. "U-um, maybe you should leave those to me? I-I just mean, I wouldn't want you to hurt yourself." Salem catches <<himself>> talking and covers <<his>> mouth, blushing. "I-I mean, uh... sorry." <<He>> looks away awkwardly.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
