:: Bog Cult Salem Read To
<<npc Salem>><<person1>>
You offer to read a book to Salem. <<He>> hesitates.
<br><br>
"I-I'm not really sure... Nobody's ever really read to me before outside of studies..." <<He>> looks a bit uncomfortable. "Uh, it's, I mean... Sorry, please go ahead." Salem settles and sits on the side of <<his>> bed. You sit alongside <<him>> and search the shelf.
<br><br>
As you suspected, there are not really any typical books, mostly manuscripts, religious theory, doctrine, and study material.
<br><br>
<<link [[Make up a story|Bog Cult Salem Story]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
