:: Bog Cult Salem Convince
<<npc Salem>><<person1>>
<<if $english gte 400>>
    Salem begins to argue but you hold <<him>> gently in your arms. "Y-you don't understand what it's like here. For my father to be who he is... I..." Salem breathes for a moment, composing <<himself>>, before speaking again. "O-okay but you can't tell anybody else, okay. T-this is between us. So... where did you want to go?"
    <br><br>
    <<if !$dailysalemdate>>
