        <br>
    <</if>>
<<else>>
    "P-please, I really am sorry but... I can't do this. N-not now. Not yet." <<He>> looks away ashamed. "I have responsibilities to the Fellowship and... I can't be breaking rules even if I want to. I'm sorry..." You comfort <<him>> as <<his>> face grows red with frustration.
