:: Salem Cafe
    <<npc Salem>><<person1>>
    As you and Salem make your way into town, <<he>> begins to slightly hide behind you. You let <<him>> trail slightly as you arrive on Danube Street. As you pass by Connudatus Street Salem's eyes go wide at the sight of so many different people. You both arrive at Cliff Street and open the door to the Ocean Breeze Cafe.
    <br><br>
    <<if $oceanbreezejob is 1 and $salemsammeet is undefined>>
        <<npc Sam 2>><<person2>>
        The two of you enter and Sam immediately catches sight of you. <<His>> eyes catch sight of the small pale <<print (C.npc.Salem.pronoun is "m" ? "boy" : "girl")>> and <<he>> lets out a warm laugh. "Now who's this cute little sweetheart." <<He>> smiles as Salem inches further behind you. "Well isn't <<person1>><<he>> a shy little thing. Let me have a look at <<him>>."
        <br><br>
        You step aside and allow Sam a good look at Salem. <<person2>><<He>> examines Salem's appearance with a critical eye. "This is my first time seeing this young <<print (C.npc.Salem.pronoun is "m" ? "man" : "woman")>>. Where is <<person1>><<he>> from?" You tell Sam that Salem is from out of town and <<person2>><<he>> claps <<his>> hands in excitement. "Oh well that is simply great, it's always nice to meet someone new. Here, why don't you order something for your first visit. On the house."
        <br><br>
        Salem stumbles over <<person1>><<his>> words as he points at something on the menu. Sam takes a look and smiles, guiding the both of you to a table as you sit side by side. You talk for a while before Sam returns, placing a dish full of fresh strawberries, blueberries, kiwi, and chunks of pineapple. Salem looks at the food and cocks <<his>> head to the side confused. "So... uh, what's this stuff?" 
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Salem Cafe 2]]>><</link>>
    <<elseif $oceanbreezejob is 1 and $salemsammeet is 1>>
        <<npc Sam 2>><<person1>>
        The two of you enter and Sam immediately catches sight of you. <<His>> eyes light up as <<he>> sees you are once again here with Salem. "Hey there sweetheart." <<He>> smiles as Salem is much less shy than their first meeting. "So Salem, what would you like today?"
        <br><br>
        <<person1>>
        Salem stutters as he glances over the menu and speaks. "U-um well, could we get the same thing we had last time?" Sam laughs warmly and gives a kind look, guiding the both of you to a table as you sit side by side. 
        <br><br>
        You talk for a while before Sam returns, placing a dish full of fresh strawberries, blueberries, kiwi, and chunks of pineapple. Salem looks at the food and it doesn't take long before <<he>> begins to eat. Unlike the first visit, Salem slows down and allows you to eat with <<him>>.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Salem Cafe 2]]>><</link>>
    <<elseif $salemcafe is 1>>
        The two of you enter and find a seat at a table by the side of the cafe. Salem hides behind the menu as a waiter comes to take your orders. You order a fruit salad for the both of you and as the waiter leaves, Salem sighs and lowers <<his>> menu. 
        <br><br>
        "T-this is so nerve wracking, I'm sorry. I have never interacted with so many people before and I'm still getting used to it." <<He>> takes a deep breath and holds your hand from across the table.
        <br><br>
        You talk for a while before the waiter returns, placing a dish full of fresh strawberries, blueberries, kiwi, and chunks of pineapple. Salem looks at the food and cocks <<his>> head to the side confused. "So... uh, what's this stuff?" 
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Salem Cafe 2]]>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        The two of you enter and find a seat at a table by the side of the cafe. Salem steels <<his>> nerves as a waiter comes to take your orders. Salem stutters as he glances over the menu and speaks. "U-um well, could we get the same thing we had last time?" 
        <br><br>
        You talk for a while before the waiter returns, placing a dish full of fresh strawberries, blueberries, kiwi, and chunks of pineapple. Salem looks at the food and it doesn't take long before <<he>> begins to eat. Unlike the first visit, Salem slows down and allows you to eat with <<him>>.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Salem Cafe 2]]>><</link>>
    <</if>>

